      "side": 1,
      "message": "I manage to fix the issue partially by forcing firefox to use \u0027true\u0027 for contenteditable. But then when i reload the page, it breaks again. Only works if you write the text, but not when it re-adds the text.\n\nThe thing i notice is it adds:\n\n```\n\u003cdiv\u003etest\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003etest\u003c/div\u003e\n```\n\nwhen it works.\n\nBut uses\n\n```\ntest\n\u003cbr/\u003e\ntest\n```\n\nwhen it doesn\u0027t.",
      "revId": "b9666e796df3c2a2016e25e466405507dc5cd917",
